[i]This is documentation for Godot 2.1, which is no longer supported or maintained by Godot. This documentation is also unofficial. Please refer to [/i][code]https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/#.html[/code][i] in a standard HTML browser. Thank you for your time, and thank you for using CWeb.[/i]
[hr]
Welcome to the CWeb documentation for Godot! Thank you for visiting. You can find any page you need by going to the search menu ([url=https://TristanHead.github.io/crsdk.doc/search.cweb]this[/url]), and you can always open the equivalent page in the standard godot documentation.
